# TNN diagnostic patterns — training corpus for tnn_diag.zag
# Extracted by the crew from committed evidence. Each pattern cites its source.
# Format: id|name|symptom_codes|check_op|check_a|check_b|check_c|fix_template
# check_op: 1=|a-b|==c, 2=a>b, 3=a<b, 4=a==b
# Symptom codes: 1=take_forced 2=no_reject 3=high_rmse_accept 4=residual_hides
#  5=construction_exposes 6=op_draws 7=vocab_measured 8=bresenham_in_path
#  9=bicubic_in_path 10=blend_in_path 11=error_persists_after_teach
#  12=constant_in_code 13=error_eq_const_minus_truth 14=textured_adj_smooth
#  15=rect_bounds_visible 16=seam_ratio_high 17=pixel_replicated 18=chunky_grid
#  19=parts_not_connected 20=whole_misplaced 21=texture_flat 22=grain_invented
#  23=no_synthesis 24=output_f_of_observed 25=edge_column_repeated
#  26=label_speckles
P1|FORCED-TAKE|1,2,3,4,5|2|44150|9000|0|Add a reject/split option at the top level when no atom fits; carry a residual-like honesty signal into construction. Source: upscale_runlog.md white-box diagnosis (region 2 forced, RMSE 44.15 vs 9 bar).
P2|OPERATOR-DRAW|6,7,8,9,10|2|3|0|0|Replace the drawing operators with measured atoms. The vocabulary is already measured; the operators are the drawing. Source: genaudit.md (tl_chord_paint/tl_bres_list, bicubic2x, 50/50 blend).
P3|HARDCODED-CONSTANT|11,12,13|1|160|182|22|Replace the hardcoded constant with a deliberated estimate from held measurements; the choice of rule must be deliberated, not cherry-picked. Then hunt the class: scan for other literals standing where measured values should be. Source: pig22px_verdict.md (head-x=160, truth 182, error 22).
P4|MIXED-REGIMES|14,15,16|2|2900|1000|0|Feather the regime boundaries (4px cross-fade); unify the reconstruction regimes so no rectangular bounds remain visible. Source: upscale_runlog.md rectangle diagnosis (seam 2.9x true at x=32, x=64).
P5|NEAREST-GRID|17,18|2|4|1|0|Blend nearest with interpolation (50/50) to halve grid contrast while keeping half the detail. Source: upscale_runlog.md (4 adjacent HR pixels get same deviation).
P6|MISSING-LAYOUT|19,20|4|0|0|0|Learn layout atoms: measured part centroids, sizes, and overlaps connecting taught parts to the whole. Source: pig22px_verdict.md section 4 (no learned layout atom; head centroid never measured).
P7|FLAT-TEXTURE|21,22|3|1100|12000|0|Measured-field transfer: every pixel equals a measured source pixel plus a measured color delta; no invented grain. Source: pig22px_verdict.md section 3 (render std 1.1 vs photo 12-14).
P8|NO-SYNTHESIS|23,24,25|4|0|0|0|Teach the vocabulary from a multi-image corpus and test prediction on a held-out image: the first true generation-from-learned-knowledge test. Source: genaudit.md (no pixel synthesized from world-knowledge; outpaint repeats edge column).
